                "title": "Clear Glass Victorian Knob with Rope Plate, Brass Accents D06-K538-VIC",
                "description": "Brass Accents D06-K538-VIC, Clear Glass Victorian Knob with Rope Plate - Made by Brass Accents, the Quartermain Plate with Victorian Knob has rope detailing along the edge of the plate that makes it a great choice for classic homes. It is adjustable for doors 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Clear Glass Victorian Knob with Rope Plate is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
